    <text x="160" y="70" fill="white" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13">Ambiguity</text>
    <text x="270" y="70" fill="white" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="13">Time</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>The three pillars, visualized.</figcaption>
</figure>

<div class="callout"><strong>Note:</strong> These pillars are necessary but not sufficient. Without a habit of <code>writing things down</code>, they collapse.</div>

<h2>A code metaphor</h2>
<pre><code>function curiosity(input) {
  const questions = expand(input);
  return questions
    .filter(q =&gt; !alreadyAnswered(q))
    .map(q =&gt; pursue(q, { patience: Infinity }));
}</code></pre>

